project (c, cn, s, mn, mx, a) (rows≈1 cost≈240)
└─ aggregate keys=[__group__] aggs=[count_0=count, count_1=count, sum_2=sum, min_3=min, max_4=max] (rows≈1 cost≈192)
   └─ project (n, __group__) (rows≈2 cost≈96)
      └─ filter (> |t.n| 100) (rows≈2 cost≈64)
         └─ source t AS t row-groups (> |t.n| 100) (rows≈4 cost≈32)
